    "decision_question": "Whether to ratify exact final workflow/state bytes for deliberation only after their independent preflight, and later whether to grant only plan-v2-bound inert source authoring; neither decision may be inferred from this proposal.",
    "forbidden_before_approval": [
      "Any workflow/model call, source or guard authoring, exact-byte ratification, import, parsing, execution, preparation, materialization, fixture/root/data generation, checker/test run, model/tokenizer/benchmark/training/GPU work, parenting, resource acquisition, scientific claim, release, or submission.",
      "Treating the existing V11 workflow proposal as authorized, final, or sufficient despite the need for an exact revised workflow/state and independent preflight.",
      "Changing the 32-record registry, 18-condition/501-slot roster, resource ceilings, visibility contract, two-source boundary provenance, finite exposure policy, authority order, or claim exclusions without renewed deliberation and exact human ratification."
    ],
    "required": true
  },
