  "schema_version": 1,
  "state": "proposed",
  "summary": "C11 binds a ratified governance-only denial corpus and proposes a future, strictly gated V11 integration. It preserves the finite supplied-memory relay as a narrow instrument while retaining Dream\u2013LoRA\u2013Think as a deferred recurrent organism. No workflow, source authoring, execution, or scientific claim is authorized.",
  "system_thesis": "Dream\u2013LoRA\u2013Think is a recurrent complete organism: lived grounded action/outcome episodes become eligible future evidence; DREAM later and without the future goal proposes local connections and re-expressions; independent later evidence supports or revokes them; SLEEP transactionally transports only validated personal semantics through parametric/LoRA state; THINK, under a later goal, retrieves, composes, plans, acts, observes, and revises; later grounded outcomes may seed future dream cycles. The C11 finite relay is not this organism: it uses supplied public memory and may at most test bounded fixed-policy use. Neither a supplied carrier nor LoRA transport is discovery; neither DREAM nor THINK alone is presumed to construct a complete solution.",
  "title": "C11 governance-bound supplied-memory relay and deferred Dream\u2013LoRA\u2013Think organism",
